// Boss fair-selection history (Razon3-style least-seen first).  Server-session
// scope: world arrays survive map changes and reset when the server restarts,
// where the zero default already means "never picked".  Slots 120/121 are free:
// the mod's highest world variable is 104:lmsdudearr and the MM8BDM v6b lumps
// declare no world variables at all (no WNAM chunk in any acs/*.o); the engine
// limit is 256 world slots.  Do not reuse Razon 3's slot 101.
world int 120:uh_bosspickcount[];   // vanilla boss ids 0..UH_MAX_VANILLA_BOSS-1
world int 121:uh_bosspickcustom[];  // custom boss ids, indexed by UH_BossCustomIndex

